    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey! Since we’re already talking about kissing, how about bringing back our old tradition of playing spin the bottle on Christmas!?! That sounds fun, right?",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Gah! Get that thing away from me! I can’t afford to destroy any more relationships!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Spin the bottle? I blacked out the last time you guys played this and can’t remember how it works.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s simple, really. Somebody spins a bottle and then has to kiss whoever it’s aiming at once it stops spinning.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But what if Kirin spins the bottle and it lands on me? We’re sisters. We’re not allowed to kiss or we’ll never make it into Heaven.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Actually, the Bible is packed to the brim with incest if you manage to filter through all the boring parts. Luckily for you, I have a sexually annotated version back in my room that I’d love to-",
      "spk": "Nodoka",
      "spkColor": "#AF89A2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ow.",
      "spk": "Nodoka",
      "spkColor": "#AF89A2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Bad. We don’t corrupt Karin. It’s against the rules.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So! Who’s up for a rousing game of “Kiss your friends while Imani is out of the room?!”",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene anotherbottle2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/anotherbottle2.webp",
      "alt": "anotherbottle2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s both irresponsible and uncalled for! As the next oldest person at the party behind Miss Imai, I forbid this completely.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Unfortunately for you, you’re my plus-one! So you don’t have any say in the fun and exciting games we play, big sister!",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Kirin, I highly doubt there is anyone else in this room who is even half as naughty as-",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Guess again, Karin!",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene anotherbottle3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/anotherbottle3.webp",
      "alt": "anotherbottle3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": My name is Rin Rokuhara...and I am here to spin a bottle.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene anotherbottle4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/anotherbottle4.webp",
      "alt": "anotherbottle4"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene anotherbottle3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/anotherbottle3.webp",
      "alt": "anotherbottle3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sh...Should I leave the room?",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No. I will accept my fate regardless of the circumstances.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And if the bottle just so happens to land on Molly, I’ll just have to thank Futaba for always keeping a travel bottle of mouthwash in her bag.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene anotherbottle5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/anotherbottle5.webp",
      "alt": "anotherbottle5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That is, unless there is someone here who would be disheartened to see me kiss another girl and would like to object before I make any rash decisions!",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I said...Unless there is someone here who would be disheartened to see me kiss another girl and would like to object before I make any rash decisions!",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why, I believe she’s talking about you.",
      "spk": "Nodoka",
      "spkColor": "#AF89A2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, really? Sorry. Was I supposed to say something there?",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene anotherbottle6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/anotherbottle6.webp",
      "alt": "anotherbottle6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I have no idea what you’re talking about. Do we even know each other? Because I don’t think we do. Who are you again?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": In the event that this bottle is aimed at me once it stops spinning, I hope you won’t hold it against me for inserting my tongue into the same mouth you used to insert your tongue into.",
      "spk": "Nodoka",
      "spkColor": "#AF89A2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Did you really have to word it like that?",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m gonna do it! I’m gonna spin the bottle! I sure hope no one stops me!",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I sure hope no one stops me!",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene anotherbottle7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/anotherbottle7.webp",
      "alt": "anotherbottle7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh no. Stop. Don’t do it.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m sorry, Futaba...but this is a decision I’ve made and I’ll have to-",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene anotherbottle8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/anotherbottle8.webp",
      "alt": "anotherbottle8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okay! Have fun!",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wha- Futaba?! Since when do you give up so easily?! Get back here and talk me out of this!",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh my fucking god, just spin the bottle or sit down and give somebody else a turn! You’re hogging all the spotlight!",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
