    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, good! You got one of your friends.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That was close. I thought for a second it was going to land on me.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sana’s first kiss is going to be with Rin?! Who could have ever predicted-",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Actually, I guess that makes sense. After Sensei or me, I guess she’d be the most likely.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Aren’t you straight?",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes, but crazier things have happened to me before. Kissing Sana was always a possibility.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Congrats, Sana! Congrats, Rin! I always knew you two would end up together!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
