    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/anotherbottle11.webp",
      "alt": "anotherbottle11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It appears that my fate has been decided.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Uh...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And unless somebody steps in-",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Nobody is going to fucking step in! Now shut up and kiss!",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Kirin! Don’t say the “K” word in public!",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Don’t you mean the “F” word?",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No!",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene anotherbottle12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/anotherbottle12.webp",
      "alt": "anotherbottle12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I will do the kissing now. It is going to happen. With both of our mouths.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": See? I’m not the only one who words things that way.",
      "spk": "Nodoka",
      "spkColor": "#AF89A2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Uh...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Here it comes. Here comes the kiss. Better...watch out! Better not cry!",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Better not pout, I’m telling you why!",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Stop stalling and go, go, go!",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
