    {
      "en": ": Idunno. I think it’d be funny. Plus, you two would make cute babies.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Have you really not had the talk with Miku yet? I think she’s overdue.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": God, I love this game. Why don’t we play it more often?",
      "spk": "Nodoka",
      "spkColor": "#AF89A2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Probably because there are roughly only three people who actually want to participate.",
