      "alt": "anotherbottle19"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Kirin! Stop! I can’t let you do this! As your older sister and current chaperone of the Christmas party, it’s my responsibility to make sure-",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, are you guys playing spin the bottle? What did I miss? Who’s kissed who?",
      "spk": "Imani",
      "spkColor": "#80C9DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
