      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The other party room.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I already told ya! We ain’t got another party room! Which means ya wandered into some stranger’s hotel and...I still don’t know how the crab comes into play here! The heck was goin’ on in that room?!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m unsure. They did not speak the same language as me — and they neglected to take the words of my Lord to heart when I tried to inform them of His message.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
