      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/anotherbottle42.webp",
      "alt": "anotherbottle42"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But they were very nice and gave me food they cooked in a large pot! As well as this award for winning a game they called “Jenga!”",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Makoto! Get your butt over here! Yasu won a crab from a Jenga match against strangers and I ain’t equipped to handle this like you are!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ugh. Again?",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Again?! How often does this happen?!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
