      "alt": "anotherbottle43"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And...how exactly will kissing some girl decided by a bottle make Ireland proud of you?",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
